      "sourceTextSha256": "d94a85fa3f7b0c9d3e115c2d5d9f02c298997aa11ca9d449c7ef1bb65a7a52ae",
      "text": "Day 5 · After breakfast, explore the Brazilian side of the falls with your guide. Follow the scenic walkways along the Iguazu River canyon and admire the panorama of hundreds of cascades framed by rainforest; the trail leads to an impressive viewpoint facing the Devil’s Throat, where the power of the water and the mist create a breathtaking spectacle of rainbows. Return to your hotel. Optional: the Macuco Safari, the Bird Park or a helicopter flight over the falls (see Optional excursions).",
